                                                "sense_id": "82c344c9-c714-3537-ad10-4ef0baba0cfb",
                                                "text": "This thesis is an attempt to apply the theory of transformational grammar to the Japanese language. […] Comparison of the structure of Japanese and English is also our concern, whenever possible, and it is seen that the transformational theory is helpful in such contrastive studies."
                                            },
